<p>If you click on its value, containing page name, it can be modified and the new inspection page will be used as thumbnail in the report.</p>
<p>There are two ways of using <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PageVariable</i></span> object - as single and as multiple page report.</p>
<p><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>See</b></span> <a href="Usage_of_PageVariable_Objects.htm">Usage of PageVariable Objects</a>.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">MainImage</p>
<p><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>MainImage</i></span> object defines size and placement of the inspection page. It should appear only once in the template.</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>x, y</b></span> top-left corner of placement rectangle.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>width, height</b></span> width and height of placement rectangle.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>fit</b></span> flag that shows whether the page view to be fitted in the placement rectangle or not can be <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>yes</i></span> or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>no</i></span>. Currently this parameter is not used and KUBE always fit the view.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example">Example:</p>
<p class="Example">&lt;MainImage x="31" y="18" width="250" height="150" fit="yes"/&gt;</p>
<p>Report page will be placed in the rectangle (31; 18) (281; 168);</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Image</p>
<p>Custom images like company logo can be placed inside the report using <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Image</i></span> object.</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>x, y</b></span> top-left corner of placement rectangle.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>width, height</b></span> width and height of placement rectangle.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>file</b></span> full path to the image file.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example">Example:</p>
<p class="Example">&lt;Image x="150" y="160" width="50" height="25" file="c:\images\MyLogo.gif"/&gt;</p>
<p>Custom logo will be placed in the rectangle (150; 160) (200; 185).</p>
<p>Image file should be in one of the following formats:</p>
