<p>If the placement rectangle is not proportional to the image size, image is scaled to the given width.</p>
<p class="Note" id="p4"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note 1:</b></span> If the placement rectangle is not proportional to the image size, image is scaled to the given width.</p>
<p class="Note" id="p5"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note 2:</b></span> For GIF and PNG with indexed colours and a transparent colour KUBE displays the transparent colour in black. Remove the transparency of you need to display the original colour.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">PageNumber</p>
<p><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PageNumber</i></span> object defines size, placement, font, style and colors of the automatic page numbering. It should appear only once in the template.</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>x, y</b></span> top-left corner of placement rectangle.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>width, height</b></span> width and height of placement rectangle. Width is automatically adjusted depending on the font size and text length. Height is automatically adjusted depending on the font size.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet" style="font-weight:bold;">font <span style="font-weight:normal;">font-family name.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>style</b></span> font style one of <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Normal</i></span>, <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Bold, Italic,</i></span> or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>BoldItalic.</i></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>size</b></span> height of font (in mm or inches).</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>underline</b></span> underlining of the text. Can be <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>yes</i></span> or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>no.</i></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>align</b></span> text alignment one of the <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>left</i></span>, <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>center</i></span>, or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>right</i></span>. See <a href="#Text_Alignment">Text Alignment</a> below for details.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>color</b></span> text color in RGB hexadecimal code <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>FFFFFF</i></span> (white), <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>FF0000</i></span> (red), <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>0000FF</i></span> (blue), <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>808080</i></span> (50% gray), <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>0</i></span> (black), etc. List of example colours with their hexadecimal codes is given in <a href="Appendix_B_Inspection.htm">Appendix B</a>.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>fill</b></span> rectangle fill color in RGB hexadecimal code. Transparent if fill = .</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>startpage</b></span> start number for page enumeration.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example">Example:</p>
<p class="Example">&lt;PageNumber x="210" y="180" width="5" height="5" font="Arial" style="Bold" size="2.6" underline="no" align="right" color="0" fill="" startpage="3"/&gt;</p>
<p>Page numbers will be placed in the rectangle (210; 180) (215; 185), using Arial Bold, right-aligned in the rectangle, appear in black, rectangle not filled, page numbers will start from 3.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Text</p>
<p><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Text</i></span> object defines size, placement, font, style, color of the desired text, fill and its contents.</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>x, y</b></span> top-left corner of placement rectangle.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>width, height</b></span> width and height of placement rectangle. Width is automatically adjusted depending on the font size and text length. Height is automatically adjusted depending on the font size.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet" style="font-weight:bold;">font <span style="font-weight:normal;">font-family name.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>style</b></span> font style one of <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Normal</i></span>, <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Bold, Italic,</i></span> or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>BoldItalic.</i></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>size</b></span> height of font (in mm or inches).</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>underline</b></span> underlining of the text. Can be <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>yes</i></span> or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>no.</i></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>align</b></span> text alignment one of the <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>left</i></span>, <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>center</i></span>, or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>right</i></span>. See <a href="#Text_Alignment">Text Alignment</a> below for details.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>color</b></span> text color in RGB hexadecimal code. List of example colours with their hexadecimal codes is given in <a href="Appendix_B_Inspection.htm">Appendix B</a>.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>fill</b></span> rectangle fill color in RGB hexadecimal code. Transparent if fill = .</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>contents</b></span> text to be displayed.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example">Example:</p>
<p class="Example">&lt;Text x="75.5" y="175.5" width="50.5" height="25.5" font="Arial" style="Italic" size="2.6" underline="no" align="left" color="0" fill="FFFF00" contents="Sample text"/&gt;</p>
<p>This will display the black-colored text "<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Sample text</b></span>" in yellow rectangle (75.5; 175.5) (126; 201) with height 2.6mm, using Arial font italic, left-aligned in the rectangle.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Variable</p>
<p><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Variable</i></span> object defines size, placement, font, style, color of the desired text, fill and its contents. In addition to <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Text</i></span> object, this object has a name and its name and content will be displayed and the text can be customised in Step 1 of <a href="Custom_Report_Generation.htm">Custom PDF Report</a> Wizard.</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>x, y</b></span> top-left corner of placement rectangle.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>width, height</b></span> width and height of placement rectangle. Width is automatically adjusted depending on the font size and text length. Height is automatically adjusted depending on the font size.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet" style="font-weight:bold;">font <span style="font-weight:normal;">font-family name.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>style</b></span> font style one of <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Normal</i></span>, <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Bold, Italic,</i></span> or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>BoldItalic.</i></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>size</b></span> height of font (in mm or inches).</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>underline</b></span> underlining of the text. Can be <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>yes</i></span> or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>no.</i></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>align</b></span> text alignment one of the <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>left</i></span>, <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>center</i></span>, or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>right</i></span>. See <a href="#Text_Alignment">Text Alignment</a> below for details.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>color</b></span> text color in RGB hexadecimal code. List of example colours with their hexadecimal codes is given in <a href="Appendix_B_Inspection.htm">Appendix B</a>.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>fill</b></span> rectangle fill color in RGB hexadecimal code. Transparent if fill = .</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>name</b></span> name of the variable. Will be displayed in the first column of the table on Step 1 from the Custom PDF Report Wizard</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>contents</b></span> text to be displayed, also will be displayed in the second column of the table on Step 1 from the Custom PDF Report Wizard.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example">Example:</p>
<p class="Example">&lt;Variable x="102.5" y="180" width="40" height="20" font="Arial" style="Bold" size="3.5" underline="yes" align="center" color="0" fill="" name="Customer" contents="Metris"/&gt;</p>
<p>This will display the black-colored text "<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Metris</b></span>" in the rectangle (102.5; 180) (142.5; 200) with height 3.5mm, using Arial bold font, center-aligned in the rectangle. Also in the table on Step 1 from the wizard this will appear like the following:</p>
