<p class="Note" id="P2"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note:</b></span> If you click on its value, containing text can be modified and the new text will be used in the report.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Box</p>
<p><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Box</i></span> object defines size and placement of a rectangle.</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>x, y</b></span> top-left corner of the rectangle.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>width, height</b></span> width and height of the rectangle.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet" style="font-weight:bold;">border <span style="font-weight:normal;">border line width.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>color</b></span> border line color in RGB hexadecimal code. List of example colours with their hexadecimal codes is given in <a href="Appendix_B_Inspection.htm">Appendix B</a>.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>fill</b></span> rectangle fill color in RGB hexadecimal code. Transparent if fill = .</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example">Example:</p>
<p class="Example">&lt;Box x="28.5" y="16" width="251.5" height="150" border="0.25" color="0" fill=""/&gt;</p>
<p>This will display a rectangle (28.5; 16) (260; 166) with black line, 0.25 mm width, no fill.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Line</p>
<p><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Line</i></span> object defines placement, width and color of a line.</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>x1, y1</b></span> line starting point.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>x2, y2</b></span> line end point.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet" style="font-weight:bold;">width <span style="font-weight:normal;">line width.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>color</b></span> line color in RGB hexadecimal code. List of example colours with their hexadecimal codes is given in <a href="Appendix_B_Inspection.htm">Appendix B</a>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example">Example:</p>
<p class="Example">&lt;Line x1="30" y1="30" x2="60" y2="50" width="1.5" color="808080"/&gt;</p>
<p>This will display a 50% gray line (30; 30) (60; 50), 1.5 mm width.</p>
<p class="Example">&#160;</p>
<h2 class="Example" style="font-family:Arial, sans-serif;"><a name="Text_Alignment"></a>Text Alignment</h2>
<p>The following scheme describes the meaning of <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>left</i></span>, <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>center</i></span>, and <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>right</i></span> values of <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>align</b></span> attribute used in <span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>PageNumber</b></i></span>, <span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Text</b></i></span>, and <span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Variable</b></i></span> objects.</p>
<p><img src="../INSPECTION_MODE_FILES/text_alignment.gif" width="362px" height="169px" border="0" class="img_whs41" alt=""></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example XML Template</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP235135105" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="Code">&lt;?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?&gt;<span style="margin-left:0px; font-family:'Courier New' , monospace; font-size:8pt; text-align:left;"><font size="1" style="font-size:8pt;"><br>
&lt;form&gt;<br>
&#160;</font></span></p>
<p class="Code">&lt;Page unit="mm" size="9" orientation="landscape" offsetx="-5" offsety="-5"/&gt;<br>
&lt;PageNumber x="216" y="178" width="5" height="5" font="Arial" style="Bold" size="2.6" underline="no" align="right" color="0" fill="" startpage="1"/&gt;<br>
&lt;MainImage x="31" y="18" width="250" height="150" fit="yes"/&gt;<br>
&lt;Box x="28.5" y="16" width="253" height="156" border="0.25" color="0" fill=""/&gt;<br>
&lt;Box x="28" y="172" width="70" height="25" border="0.25" color="0" fill=""/&gt;<br>
&lt;Box x="98" y="172" width="39" height="10" border="0.25" color="0" fill=""/&gt;<br>
&lt;Box x="98" y="182" width="39" height="15" border="0.25" color="0" fill=""/&gt;<br>
&lt;Box x="137" y="172" width="63" height="10" border="0.25" color="0" fill=""/&gt;<br>
&lt;Box x="200" y="172" width="24" height="10" border="0.25" color="0" fill=""/&gt;<br>
&lt;Box x="137" y="182" width="52" height="15" border="0.25" color="0" fill=""/&gt;<br>
